ways like me?\"", "words": [{"text": "\"Did", "start": 127.633, "end": 127.773}, {"text": "you", "start": 127.773, "end": 127.933}, {"text": "always", "start": 127.933, "end": 128.313}, {"text": "like", "start": 128.313, "end": 128.653}, {"text": "me?\"", "start": 128.653, "end": 128.973}]}, {"start": 129.525, "end": 132.384, "text": "Your brain completely stops working.", "words": [{"text": "Your", "start": 129.525, "end": 129.665}, {"text": "brain", "start": 129.665, "end": 130.105}, {"text": "completely", "start": 130.105, "end": 130.985}, {"text": "stops", "start": 130.985, "end": 131.725}, {"text": "working.", "start": 131.725, "end": 132.165}]}, {"start": 132.834, "end": 139.4, "text": "You finally admit it. But before you can say anything else, she tells you something unexpected.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 132.834, "end": 132.994}, {"text": "finally", "start": 132.994, "end": 133.494}, {"text": "admit", "start": 133.494, "end": 134.014}, {"text": "it.", "start": 134.014, "end": 134.234}, {"text": "But", "start": 134.874, "end": 135.194}, {"text": "before", "start": 135.194, "end": 135.494}, {"text": "you", "start": 135.494, "end": 135.674}, {"text": "can", "start": 135.674, "end": 135.814}, {"text": "say", "start": 135.814, "end": 136.034}, {"text": "anything", "start": 136.034, "end": 136.374}, {"text": "else,", "start": 136.374, "end": 136.734}, {"text": "she", "start": 137.314, "end": 137.474}, {"text": "tells", "start": 137.474, "end": 137.734}, {"text": "you", "start": 137.734, "end": 137.934}, {"text": "something", "start": 137.934, "end": 138.214}, {"text": "unexpected.", "start": 138.214, "end": 138.754}]}, {"start": 139.85, "end": 142.33, "text": "\"Good. Because I was hoping you'd say that.\"", "words": [{"text": "\"Good.", "start": 139.85, "end": 140.11}, {"text": "Because", "start": 140.51, "end": 140.95}, {"text": "I", "start": 140.95, "end": 141.11}, {"text": "was", "start": 141.11, "end": 141.23}, {"text": "hoping", "start": 141.23, "end": 141.47}, {"text": "you'd", "start": 141.47, "end": 141.77}, {"text": "say", "start": 141.77, "end": 141.93}, {"text": "that.\"", "start": 141.93, "end": 142.11}]}, {"start": 142.78, "end": 145.82, "text": "The next morning, the weather is perfect.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 142.78, "end": 143.0}, {"text": "next", "start": 143.0, "end": 143.26}, {"text": "morning,", "start": 143.26, "end": 143.7}, {"text": "the", "start": 144.02, "end": 144.12}, {"text": "weather", "start": 144.12, "end": 144.48}, {"text": "is", "start": 144.48, "end": 144.98}, {"text": "perfect.", "start": 144.98, "end": 145.54}]}, {"start": 146.27, "end": 149.912, "text": "You finally figure out how to contact someone and arrange a way back.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 146.27, "end": 146.39}, {"text": "finally", "start": 146.39, "end": 146.75}, {"text": "figure", "start": 146.75, "end": 147.11}, {"text": "out", "start": 147.11, "end": 147.39}, {"text": "how", "start": 147.39, "end": 147.57}, {"text": "to", "start": 147.57, "end": 147.67}, {"text": "contact", "start": 147.67, "end": 148.03}, {"text": "someone", "start": 148.03, "end": 148.47}, {"text": "and", "start": 148.47, "end": 148.79}, {"text": "arrange", "start": 148.79, "end": 149.09}, {"text": "a", "start": 149.09, "end": 149.37}, {"text": "way", "start": 149.37, "end": 149.53}, {"text": "back.", "start": 149.53, "end": 149.77}]}, {"start": 150.362, "end": 153.675, "text": "But neither of you seems particularly excited about leaving.", "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 150.362, "end": 150.41}, {"text": "neither", "start": 150.41, "end": 150.459}, {"text": "of", "start": 150.459, "end": 150.846}, {"text": "you", "start": 153.384, "end": 153.433}, {"text": "seems", "start": 153.433, "end": 153.481}, {"text": "particularly", "start": 153.481, "end": 153.53}, {"text": "excited", "start": 153.53, "end": 153.578}, {"text": "about", "start": 153.578, "end": 153.627}, {"text": "leaving.", "start": 153.627, "end": 153.675}]}, {"start": 154.125, "end": 162.468, "text": "As the sun rises, she looks at you and says: \"Maybe we should get lost together again sometime.\"", "words": [{"text": "As", "start": 154.125, "end": 154.265}, {"text": "the", "start": 154.265, "end": 154.385}, {"text": "sun", "start": 154.385, "end": 154.645}, {"text": "rises,", "start": 154.645, "end": 155.145}, {"text": "she", "start": 155.565, "end": 155.645}, {"text": "looks", "start": 155.645, "end": 155.825}, {"text": "at", "start": 155.825, "end": 156.025}, {"text": "you", "start": 156.025, "end": 156.185}, {"text": "and", "start": 156.185, "end": 156.345}, {"text": "says:", "start": 156.345, "end": 156.645}, {"text": "\"Maybe", "start": 157.545, "end": 158.065}, {"text": "we", "start": 158.065, "end": 158.265}, {"text": "should", "start": 158.265, "end": 158.445}, {"text": "get", "start": 158.445, "end": 158.645}, {"text": "lost", "start": 158.645, "end": 159.045}, {"text": "together", "start": 159.045, "end": 159.585}, {"text": "again", "start": 159.585, "end": 160.125}, {"text": "sometime.\"", "start": 160.125, "end": 160.865}]}, {"start": 162.918, "end": 167.588, "text": "And honestly... You wouldn't mind getting stuck there for another week.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 162.918, "end": 163.298}, {"text": "honestly...", "start": 163.298, "end": 164.518}, {"text": "You", "start": 164.518, "end": 164.958}, {"text": "wouldn't", "start": 164.958, "end": 165.278}, {"text": "mind", "start": 165.278, "end": 165.558}, {"text": "getting", "start": 165.558, "end": 165.898}, {"text": "stuck", "start": 165.898, "end": 166.278}, {"text": "there", "start": 166.278, "end": 166.638}, {"text": "for", "start": 166.638, "end": 166.838}, {"text": "another", "start": 166.838, "end": 167.078}, {"text": "week.", "start": 167.078, "end": 167.378}]}]}